+## Authentication
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are stored in the data as
+`apiKeys: [{ "key", "name", "role" }]`.
+
+- `viewer`: GET only.
+- `cook`: also `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
